+        
+    -   **Uniform_Hemisphere_Solid_Angle**:
+        $$ \text{pdf} = \frac{1}{2\pi} $$
+        $$ L_r += f_r L_i (1 - \text{inShadow}) \cos\theta_i 2\pi $$
+        [S1, unofficial]
